- [ ] Approval is required before executable JSON is saved; approved content and hash match what is verified.
- [ ] Verification failure leaves project setup not-ready and reports the failing phase.
- [ ] Startup/readiness/cleanup work for configured local services; command arguments containing spaces survive unchanged.
- [ ] Commands and logs do not persist supplied secret values.
- [ ] The runner enforces timeouts and records owned child processes on all supported platforms.
- [ ] This slice's behavioral regression tests pass: `bun test tests/integration/02-project-commands.test.ts`.
- [ ] Type checking and lint pass; no unsupported platform is silently excluded.
- [ ] The demonstrable flow below works through the public command/adapter boundary.

